{"1181550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Carnival Hunt", "steam_appid": 1181550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE HUNT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/2b955ab137be8a59198c0dda90c6c6f4.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/2b955ab137be8a59198c0dda90c6c6f4.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carnival Hunt is a 5v1 first-person asymmetrical horror game set within a twisted carnival world created by the Puppetmaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five players become fragile wind-up Bunnies who must work together, complete objectives, and find a way to escape. One player becomes the Carnival Monster, hunting them before they can complete their performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both sides depend on their wind-up charge to survive. Bunnies must manage limited keys and keep one another moving, while the Monster must capture Bunnies and consume their keys to remain active.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every key makes noise. Every mistake can reveal your position. Every second brings the performance closer to its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE AS THE BUNNIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/04ad59ee39472002eb55ef5d4846533e.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/04ad59ee39472002eb55ef5d4846533e.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/04ad59ee39472002eb55ef5d4846533e.mp4?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together as a team of five wind-up Bunnies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives, explore the map, share resources, and coordinate your escape before the Carnival Monster finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bunnies are not powerful fighters. Survival depends on teamwork, careful movement, resource management, and knowing when to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A separated Bunny is an easy target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP EACH OTHER WOUND UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/77662eb289bfaa738ae35c64872d6940.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/77662eb289bfaa738ae35c64872d6940.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/77662eb289bfaa738ae35c64872d6940.mp4?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wind-up charge gradually runs down throughout the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keys to keep yourself moving, wind up your teammates, and activate important mechanisms. Keys are limited, and using them creates noise that can reveal your location to the Monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend them carelessly, and your team may not have enough charge to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunnies must keep one another moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is a resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY DEAD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/171a76cc6e030ed6b62533db0befc283.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/171a76cc6e030ed6b62533db0befc283.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/171a76cc6e030ed6b62533db0befc283.mp4?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groups of fallen Bunnies can be found throughout the carnival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide among them and pretend to be one of the lifeless puppets when the Monster approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monster can inspect the bodies one by one, but every search costs precious time and charge. Remain still, stay convincing, and hope the Monster chooses incorrectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME THE CARNIVAL MONSTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/6a0a6914c56b851a295edf36c279085a.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/6a0a6914c56b851a295edf36c279085a.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/6a0a6914c56b851a295edf36c279085a.mp4?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the Carnival Monster and stop the Bunnies before they escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track their movements, disrupt their objectives, separate the group, and consume their wind-up keys to extend your own charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Monster has unique abilities designed around hunting, deception, pressure, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict where the Bunnies will go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punish their mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break their coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY SOUND MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/3fd32bc227363b527afda6f7ae58ad2e.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/3fd32bc227363b527afda6f7ae58ad2e.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/3fd32bc227363b527afda6f7ae58ad2e.mp4?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player experiences the hunt from a first-person perspective, limiting situational awareness and keeping danger just outside their field of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use positional voice chat to communicate with your teammates, but be careful. The Monster may be listening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winding keys, activating mechanisms, moving through the environment, and communicating at the wrong moment can expose your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes silence is the safest strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WORLD OF DEADLY PERFORMANCES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/c89d5b637aff6d85a75487fd2761ead9.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/c89d5b637aff6d85a75487fd2761ead9.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally arranged map layouts built from 32 modular rooms across several carnival themes. Routes, room connections, and the spaces you encounter can change from one match to the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hunt challenges the Bunnies to understand their surroundings, complete their objectives, and adapt before the Monster brings the performance to an end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monster performs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bunnies perform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even death has a role to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRESS FOR THE OCCASION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character and enter the carnival dressed to impress, intimidate, or deceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, every performer needs the right costume.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind your friends. Protect your keys. Listen carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The carnival is waiting.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE HUNT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/2b955ab137be8a59198c0dda90c6c6f4.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/2b955ab137be8a59198c0dda90c6c6f4.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carnival Hunt is a 5v1 first-person asymmetrical horror game set within a twisted carnival world created by the Puppetmaster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five players become fragile wind-up Bunnies who must work together, complete objectives, and find a way to escape. One player becomes the Carnival Monster, hunting them before they can complete their performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both sides depend on their wind-up charge to survive. Bunnies must manage limited keys and keep one another moving, while the Monster must capture Bunnies and consume their keys to remain active.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every key makes noise. Every mistake can reveal your position. Every second brings the performance closer to its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE AS THE BUNNIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/04ad59ee39472002eb55ef5d4846533e.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/04ad59ee39472002eb55ef5d4846533e.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/04ad59ee39472002eb55ef5d4846533e.mp4?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together as a team of five wind-up Bunnies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives, explore the map, share resources, and coordinate your escape before the Carnival Monster finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bunnies are not powerful fighters. Survival depends on teamwork, careful movement, resource management, and knowing when to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A separated Bunny is an easy target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP EACH OTHER WOUND UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"