ss=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Monster can inspect the bodies one by one, but every search costs precious time and charge. Remain still, stay convincing, and hope the Monster chooses incorrectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME THE CARNIVAL MONSTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/6a0a6914c56b851a295edf36c279085a.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/6a0a6914c56b851a295edf36c279085a.webm?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/6a0a6914c56b851a295edf36c279085a.mp4?t=1784823412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the Carnival Monster and stop the Bunnies before they escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track their movements, disrupt their objectives, separate the group, and consume their wind-up keys to extend your own charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Monster has unique abilities designed around hunting, deception, pressure, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict where the Bunnies will go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punish their mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break their coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY SOUND MATTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/3fd32bc227363b527afda6f7ae58ad2e.poster.avif?t=1784823412\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/extras/3fd32bc227363b527afda6f7ae58ad2e.webm?t=1784823412\" t