ESS FOR THE OCCASION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character and enter the carnival dressed to impress, intimidate, or deceive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, every performer needs the right costume.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind your friends. Protect your keys. Listen carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The carnival is waiting.</p>", "short_description": "Carnival Hunt is a 5v1 first-person asymmetrical horror game. Five wind-up Bunnies must work together, manage their noisy keys, and find a way to escape an ever-changing carnival world while one player hunts them as the Carnival Monster.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Danish, Czech<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/header.jpg?t=1784823412", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/fb4d120ea0f602d26197c83e78511ad0a81afe2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784823412", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181550/fb4d120ea0f602d26197c83e78511ad0a81afe2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784823412", "website": "https://discord.gg/C5MNNgyGNY", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 2600 / i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> We highly recommend to have a microphone as this game depends on in-game communication.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recomm